«
@@ ============================================================
@@ UTCtoGPS — UTC date and time to GPS week and time of week. GPS time
@@ started on 1980-01-06 at 0h UTC and is 18 s ahead of UTC since 2017-01-01.
@@ 
@@ Input : date time — date as YYYYMMDD, UTC time as HH.MMSS.
@@ Output: week tow — week number without rollover, seconds in the week.
@@ Dates before 2017 have other leap seconds, and stop with an error. A leap
@@ second added after 2026 would need a new offset here.
@@ ============================================================

  → dat tme
  «
    dat DUP TypeName "unit" == « UVAL » « » IFTE EVAL
    → dnm
    «
      IF dnm 20170101 < THEN "UTCtoGPS needs a date from 2017 on" DOERR END
      @ Dates as decimals: on a DM32, integer dates are rejected (issue #1873)
      dnm →Num 19800106. DDays DUP TypeName "unit" == « UVAL » « » IFTE EVAL
      86400 * tme HMS→ 3600 * + 18 +
      → scd
      «
        scd 604800 / FLOOR R→I
        scd 604800 MOD DUP FP 0 = « R→I » IFT 1_s *
      »
    »
  »
»
